   3330  8000							; 1K Frequency Table.
   3331  8000							; Fred Quimby, Darrell Spice Jr, Chris Walton 2010
   3332  8000							;
   3333  8000							; The 1K Frequency Table can contain up to 256 frequency values
   3334  8000							;
   3335  8000							; Table entries are defined as 2^32*freq/20000
   3336  8000							;
   3337  8000							; If User ARM code is being used, then the last 512 bytes of the frequency
   3338  8000							; table will no longer be available, reducing the number of frequencies you can
   3339  8000							; use to 128.
   3340  8000
   3341  8000							; piano key frequencies (s = sharp)
